<title>USA: NCO Group to buy CRW collections unit.</title>
<headline>NCO Group to buy CRW collections unit.</headline>
<dateline>BLUE BELL, Pa. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>NCO Group Inc said on Monday it agreed to buy the Collections Division of CRW Financial Inc for $12.8 million in cash and stock.</p>
<p>The deal for the accounts-receivable management provider involves $3.75 in cash, 345,178 common-stock shares and warrants for 250,000 common shares.</p>
<p>NCO said the deal would not dilute its earnings per share in 1997, and is expected to be accretive in 1998.</p>
